    fix: skip 0-check history records in persist_validate_history (LORE-066).
    
    validate --execute was persisting a history record for the unclassified
    bucket (and any zero-check class) claiming "commands parse and answer on
    the live system" when total_checks == 0 — 225 of 3,161 ledger rows
    (7.1%) were empty evidence records. Skip persisting records with zero
    checks.
    
    Also fix test count drift (557→560) across docs and update the LORE-045
    test that expected unclassified to write a record.
    
    Tests: tests/test_lore066_zero_check_skip.py (3 new), tests/test_lore045_validate_history.py (1 modified). Addresses LORE-066.
